    "detailed_description": "The game is a wildfire fighter simulation set in an open-world environment. Players take on the role of a firefighter and use vehicles such as a helicopter or plane to battle and suppress raging wildfires in different landscapes. The game features realistic forest fire simulation and fast-paced firefighting action. Players must be quick to react and take action in emergency situations to succeed. The game is single player and played from both first and third person perspectives.",
